# No reference links

[Full](https://example.com), [ref](https://example.com) and [ref](https://example.com), an image ![alt](image.png) and [brackets \\[x\\]](https://example.com/a_\(b\)).

A [Mixed][] case label is not looked up.

[ref]: https://example.com
[img]: image.png
[paren]: https://example.com/a_(b)
[mixed]: https://example.com/mixed

